<article class="qh__prose node node--type-ridoh-org node--view-mode-full">

      <h1>Perinatal Hepatitis Prevention Program</h1>
  
    
    <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
      <div class="block block-layout-builder block-extra-field-blocknoderidoh-orglinks">
  
    
      
  </div>
<div class="qh__prose block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknoderidoh-orgfield-page-content-components">
  
    
        

  

            <h2>Mission</h2>
<p>To prevent perinatal hepatitis infection in infants.</p>
<h2>What we do</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Offer&nbsp;</strong>screening, referral, and case management services for pregnant women and new mothers infected with chronic&nbsp;<a href="/node/22911">hepatitis B</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a href="/node/20001">hepatitis C</a>&nbsp;virus.</li>
<li><strong>Partner&nbsp;</strong>with Women and Infant's Hospital, Hasbro Children's Hospital, and the VNA of Care New England.</li>
<li><strong>Provide&nbsp;</strong>free at-home&nbsp;<a href="/node/22876">nurse visits</a>&nbsp;to pregnant women and new mothers to educate them about hepatitis,&nbsp;<a href="/node/20076">breastfeeding</a>, nutrition, and community resources such as the <a href="/node/22541">Special Supplemental Nutrition Program for Women, Infants, and Children (WIC)</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Coordinate&nbsp;</strong>care for women with&nbsp;<a href="/diseases/hep/?parm=4">hepatitis B</a> virus and their infants to ensure they complete the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.vaccineinformation.org/diseases/hepatitis-b/">hepatitis B vaccination</a> series and undergo recommended immunity testing.</li>
<li><strong>Follow&nbsp;</strong>the infants born to women with&nbsp;<a href="/node/20001">hepatitis C</a>&nbsp;virus to ensure they get the recommended testing for&nbsp;hepatitis C&nbsp;virus.</li>
</ul>

      


  </div>
<div class="views-element-container block block-views block-views-blockri-doh-org-contact-block-1">
  
    
      <div><div class="view view-ri-doh-org-contact view-id-ri_doh_org_contact view-display-id-block_1 js-view-dom-id-bdc91c00303c586bfa8debb436da8e0bd81ec3538ef74acd76208d7558ead402">
  
